<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=698" title="View the profile of Deiena">Deiena</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/homersmind.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=266153280" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=266153280&amp;img=5" alt="266153280" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=fiercestharmony"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=fiercestharmony&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="fiercestharmony" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=BishImpersonator&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="BishImpersonator" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=698"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:fiercestharmony@sbcglobal.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10079#msg10079"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10079#msg10079">Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> August 14, 2004, 07:10:06 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;m wondering how many of you will be leaving to for EverQuest 2....<br /><br />I know a number of guilds on RN are still pushing toward being Time flagged (my fiance&#039;s guild for one) and have a lot of time invested in your characters..<br /><br />I&#039;ve only been playing since February and I&#039;m a little disheartened that the honeymoon may be over soon.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10082"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665" title="View the profile of Naithein">Naithein</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 67<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ninja1.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I like pie!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/laldayen@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="laldayen@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=naithein%40yahoo.com"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=naithein%40yahoo.com&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="naithein@yahoo.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=PadisharrCreel&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="PadisharrCreel" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.xanga.com/naithein" title="" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:laldayen@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10082#msg10082"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10082#msg10082">Re: Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> August 14, 2004, 11:43:33 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Alot of folks look at it like this:<br /><br />Everquest is old, so they think it sucks, they want new things. new Items, etc. <br /><br />Of course the few loyalists out there know that thats major&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" /> <br /><br />So, bascically their saying (everyone thats leaving,)<br /><br />Nooo Good Everquest... = ... No Money<br /><br />They want something that&#039;s worth paying for.&nbsp; Either way,&nbsp; With the upcomming realeses such as<br /><br />Everquest 2, World of Warcraft, Middle Earth Online, Matrix online, etc.&nbsp; <br /><br />Everquest isn&#039;t going to last long. <br /><br />(BTW: Where the f*ck is the spellchek, I need it pweeze)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />&quot;Sometimes we are not equipt for the challenges life puts in our path. . . but we have to do the best with who we are&quot; - Terry Brooks
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10084"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 51<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10084#msg10084"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10084#msg10084">Re: Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> August 14, 2004, 11:48:16 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Same arguement that was made when DAOC, SWG etc came out. Mostly what happens is people leave to play those games, realize they aren&#039;t as much fun, then come back.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
