								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/skull4.png" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								A Shadowknight who believes he isn&#039;t useless<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=426"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
